        "text": "According to Petitioners (Travelers Indemnity Company), according to Petitioners (Travelers Indemnity Company), in 1986 the bankruptcy court issued an order that was intended to enjoin direct actions against Travelers based on the insurance policies Manville purchased from Travelers."
