              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners (Travelers Indemnity Company), according to Petitioners (Travelers Indemnity Company), the Second Circuit, in 1988, affirmed that a bankruptcy court exercising its core jurisdiction properly confirmed the reorganization plan that resolved present and future claims against Johns\u2011Manville and its insurers."
